OL,3,GNEWSAWoman charged with 2023 murder of
OL,4,Aman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman is due to appear in court
OL,7,Fcharged with murdering a man three
OL,8,Fyears ago.
OL,10,FSaid Mohamed, 30, died after an
OL,11,Fincident at his home in Sewell Road,
OL,12,FBradford, on 4 June 2023.
OL,14,FWest Yorkshire Police said on Thursday
OL,15,Fthat Naimo Ibrahim, 36, had since been
OL,16,Fcharged with his murder.
OL,18,FIbrahim, also of Sewell Road, had been
OL,19,Fremanded in custody and was due to
OL,20,Fappear at Bradford Magistrates' Court
OL,21,Flater, police said.
